Package: multiPPI
Type: Package
Title: Conventional PPI and Task-Modulated Covariance for fMRI
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    c(person(given="Brad", family="Buchsbaum", role=c("aut","cre"), email="brad.buchsbaum@gmail.com"))
Description: Conventional psychophysiological interaction and generalized PPI
    regression with run-local deconvolution, named contrasts and temporal
    prewhitening through 'fmriAR'. Separate covariance-modulation estimators
    provide per-regressor slope matrices and lagged variants. Includes
    design and data adapters, derived connectivity quantities, and explicitly
    experimental resampling procedures.
